    "last_updated": "2026-04-30",
    "changelog": [
      "v1.0 (2026-04-30): Initial build from manual solenoid/lamp/switch screenshots. All three sections image-verified. Sound commands stubbed."
    ],
    "diagnostic_notes": [
      "IMPORTANT: Taxi runs on System 11B (D-11883-553), NOT System 11A (D-11392). No board JSON exists for D-11883 yet. PIA addresses and decode parameters must be established before firmware capture work begins on this game.",
      "Aux Power Driver Board is D-12247, not D-11813 as on System 11A games. Connector layout differs -- solenoid connectors are 2J5/2J10/2J8 vs 1P11/1P12/1P19 on System 11A.",
      "SW2 (A/C Relay C-Side) is a relay position feedback switch -- CPU reads whether Sol12 relay is actually energized. Unique among the four demo games.",
      "SW24 (Tips Carried) is a mechanical sensor detecting passenger pickup.",
      "Sol9 (Top Ball Gate) uses SM1-35-4000-DC motor-type solenoid.",
      "Sol13 (Bell) uses SM-26-600-DC -- physical bell coil, not a kickback.",
      "Upper flipper circuits (upper right and upper left) are listed in the manual but NOT populated on the game -- Taxi does not have upper flippers. Standard D-11883 board template includes them regardless."
    ]
  },

