      "Williams System 11B switch numbering: column-major order. SW1-8=Col1, SW9-16=Col2, etc.",
      "Column strobe transistors identical to System 11A D-11392 (Q45/49/44/48/43/47/42/46). Row connectors identical (1J10-9 through 1J10-1).",
      "Cols 6 and 7 almost entirely Not Used -- only SW43 (Top Kicker) and SW44 (Spinout) populated in col 6.",
      "SW57/58 (Right/Left Flipper) in col 8 rows 1/2 -- different position from System 11A games where lane change flippers were col 7 rows 7/8.",
      "SW2 (A/C Relay C-Side): relay position feedback switch, not a playfield switch.",
      "Two separate 3-bank drop target assemblies: Mid bank SW27-29 (col4 rows 3-5), Right bank SW30-32 (col4 rows 6-8).",
      "SW24 (Tips Carried): mechanical sensor detecting passenger in cab."
