  "solenoids": {
    "notes": [
      "System 11B D-11883-553. Solenoid architecture similar to System 11A but on different board. Connector layout differs: 2J5/2J10/2J8 vs 1P11/1P12/1P19 on System 11A.",
      "Aux Power Driver Board is D-12247 (not D-11813 as on System 11A games).",
      "A/C RELAY (Sol12): A-coils active when Sol12 de-energized, C-coils (flashers) active when Sol12 energized.",
      "Sol9 Top Ball Gate: SM1-35-4000-DC motor-type solenoid, not a standard coil.",
      "Sol13 Bell: SM-26-600-DC physical bell coil.",
      "Sol4A Middle 3-bank reset and Sol6A Right 3-bank reset: two separate drop target assemblies.",
      "Sol7A Spinout Kickbig and Sol8A Right Lock both use AE-26-1500 -- heavier coils.",
      "GI relays Sol10/11 use 5580-12145-01 (motor relay part) not the usual 5580-09555-01.",
      "bcd_code: null throughout -- System 11B PIA addresses not yet established. D-11883 board JSON does not exist. Decode parameters TBD.",
      "driver_path fields reference D-11883 component designators where known from image; full paths TBD pending board JSON."
    ],
